Ever heard of the Skeleton?

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:15.130
Anyone who hasn't tried it is lame.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:17.160
Then I must try it!

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:24.020
The race is coming to a climax.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.980
Hit and interfere!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:29.640
It's the death course where anything goes!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.440
That's why it's the most dangerous
sport in the world!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.150
Now who will be left standing?

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:40.110
Hey, there's a racer
leaving the pack!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:43.780
Haha!
At this rate, the rest will be history!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:46.160
You left trash, so I picked it up.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.660
I-Idiot! I set that explosive!

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.890
Oh no, he blew himself up!

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:59.670
The rest of the racers are
picking up speed!

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.800
Get out of the way!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:03.900
- What?!
- Boys...

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.680
- A family of penguins!
- Be careful now.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:14.500
Oh, something terrible has happened!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.190
I hope the penguins are safe.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:21.120
Okay, back to the race.
Popuko is unhurt and in the lead.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.720
Wait! There's another racer
who jumps into the lead!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:30.200
Whoosh

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:30.210
The "R" in GTR stands for
the legend who is invincible!

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:33.280
Is this it for Popuko?

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.730
H-Hold it. Look at that?

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:37.210
Yay!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.720
It's Coach Pipimi!
Look at her go!

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:47.690
Coach Pipimi's
super turbo engine and sharp tip,

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.230
That's right, turbo.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.340
is a beauty of aeronautics and form,

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.500
Yup, sharp.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.240
Totally ideal.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:54.870
worthy of being known as
the mad dog of the circuit.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.800
Woof, woof.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.730
And when we merge,
our speed doubles.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.240
<i>You got boost power!</i>

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:04.240
What?
How can they do that me, the GTR?!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:09.310
Popuko blasts GTR!

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:14.630
The 2018 Skeleton World Grand Prix!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:19.350
The winner of the gold medal is Popuko!

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.760
Hey, what's this?

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.480
