we just received...

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:29.200
Suspicion of drug use has arisen
over Popuko's unusual behavior.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.270
What?!
It seems Popuko has a mechanical body!

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:38.520
Oh well, now that it's out, it's over!

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.220
Ca-chunk! Ca-chunk!

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.220
